  "details": "Just a simple pen that you could pull out and write on a print could bring many new possibilities! Wanna draw a funny mustache on a photo with a friend? Sure! Met that one cool person and took a pic with em? Why not have them sign it too? Wanna just draw something for someone and then toss it at them? This would allow it!\n\nPeople have already shown a lot of creativity when it comes to using prints, and this could take it to a whole new level! \n\nWould be nice if the drawn-on print could then be saved. Or to have an option to print a blank paper to draw on with nothing \"in the way\".",
